            <p class="CiteTOC"><a href="../Flagstaff09/Flagstaff0905000.html#9.05.001.0008">9-05-001-0008</a>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;OPERATION ON SIDEWALKS AND MULTIUSE PATHS</p>

            <p class="CiteTOC"><a href="../Flagstaff09/Flagstaff0905000.html#9.05.001.0009">9-05-001-0009</a>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;BICYCLE REGISTRATION</p>

